     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I want to do a little exercise to enhance Stan math library by the</div><div>Matérn covariance matrices, in same fashion of Stan&#39;s cov_exp_quad</div><div>function. </div><div><br></div><div>See a definition here:</div><div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mat%C3%A9rn_covariance_function\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mat%25C3%25A9rn_covariance_function&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458059697000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gBnEKmLStlILwpr563phV\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mat%C3%A9rn_covariance_function</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>I only want to implement given the 3 cases for nu in {1/2, 3/2, 5/2}.</div><div><br></div><div>I checked out Stan math library:</div><div>$ git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/math\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/math&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458059697000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MWmsgwDvyH6kL2FCu6Bsi\">https://github.com/stan-dev/math</a><br></div><div><br></div><div> in the makefile, I change the CC variable to g++.</div><div><br></div><div>Then I executed:</div><div><br></div><div><div>$ make test-headers</div></div><div><br></div><div>gives me however:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file included </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">command</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">./</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fun</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">promote_elements</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">static</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> member </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#008\">static</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">promote_elements</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">promote</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">const</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;&amp;)’:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">./</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fun</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">promote_elements</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">30</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size_t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> was </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scope<br>         </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size_t i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">();</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">++</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">^</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">./</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fun</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">promote_elements</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">30</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> note</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> suggested alternatives</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file included </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">++/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bits</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stl_algobase</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">h</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">59</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color